  "maintenanceNote": "Generated by the pinned npm package @openai/codex@0.166.0 vendor binary with `codex app-server generate-json-schema`. Its npm packument has no gitHead. The clean snapshot contains 321 JSON schemas: seven added, none removed, and 48 changed from 0.160.0. Consumed request fields, item discriminants and Turn statuses remain compatible. The adapter excludes the new partial_answer phase from final candidates and aligns process/thread provider selection for the new native mismatch check. The native runtime-hint reader compares the complete header projection after excluding only body-only tool_namespaces_info, retaining both 16 KiB encoded-input bounds. Refresh only through explicit maintenance work, remove stale generated JSON files, and preserve generated-schema/README.md.",
